==============================================================================================
 PATTERN / REFRAME
==============================================================================================
  k_min is the DIMENSION of the smallest axis-aligned subcube meeting every S_n-orbit.
  f_max=m-k_min FIXED arcs GAUGE-FIX the relabeling symmetry; the bound f_max<=log2(n!) is the
  symmetry entropy. Naive Ham-path fixes only n-1 (weak); optimal fixes ~log2(n!) (strong gauge).
DONE.
